     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">I have this code:</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);border-radius:3px;display:inline;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important\">  x = R.list(a: (1..10), beta: R.exp(-3..3), logic: R.c(TRUE,FALSE,FALSE,TRUE))\r\n\r\n  # compute the list mean for each list element\r\n  mean = R.lapply(x, &quot;mean&quot;)\r\n  mean.pp\r\n</code></pre><p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Outputs fine (no error):</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);border-radius:3px;display:inline;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important\">$a\r\n[1] 5,5\r\n\r\n$beta\r\n[1] 4,53512523476476\r\n\r\n$logic\r\n[1] 0,5\r\n</code></pre><p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Then</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);border-radius:3px;display:inline;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important\">  # median and quartiles for each list element\r\n  quant = R.lapply(x, &quot;quantile&quot;)\r\n</code></pre><p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Outputs:</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);border-radius:3px;display:inline;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important\">  &quot;Invalid argument:\\n\\tpsort(logical, double)\\n\\tExpected:\\n\\tpsort(IntVector, Vector)\\n\\tpsort(DoubleVector, Vector)&quot;\r\n</code></pre><div title=\"MDH:SSBoYXZlIHRoaXMgY29kZTo8ZGl2Pjxicj48L2Rpdj48ZGl2PiZuYnNwOyAmbmJzcDsgJm5ic3A7\r\nIHggPSBSLmxpc3QoYTogKDEuLjEwKSwgYmV0YTogUi5leHAoLTMuLjMpLCBsb2dpYzogUi5jKFRS\r\nVUUsRkFMU0UsRkFMU0UsVFJVRSkpPC9kaXY+PGRpdj48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj4mbmJzcDsgJm5i\r\nc3A7ICZuYnNwOyAjIGNvbXB1dGUgdGhlIGxpc3QgbWVhbiBmb3IgZWFjaCBsaXN0IGVsZW1lbnQ8\r\nL2Rpdj48ZGl2PiZuYnNwOyAmbmJzcDsgJm5ic3A7IG1lYW4gPSBSLmxhcHBseSh4LCAibWVhbiIp\r\nPC9kaXY+PGRpdj4mbmJzcDsgJm5ic3A7ICZuYnNwOyBtZWFuLnBwPC9kaXY+PGRpdj48YnI+PC9k\r\naXY+PGRpdj5PdXRwdXRzOjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+PGRpdj4mbmJzcDsgJm5i\r\nc3A7ICRhPC9kaXY+PGRpdj4mbmJzcDsgJm5ic3A7IFsxXSA1LDU8L2Rpdj48ZGl2Pjxicj48L2Rp\r\ndj48ZGl2PiZuYnNwOyAmbmJzcDsgJGJldGE8L2Rpdj48ZGl2PiZuYnNwOyAmbmJzcDsgWzFdIDQs\r\nNTM1MTI1MjM0NzY0NzY8L2Rpdj48ZGl2Pjxicj48L2Rpdj48ZGl2PiZuYnNwOyAmbmJzcDsgJGxv\r\nZ2ljPC9kaXY+PGRpdj4mbmJzcDsgJm5ic3A7IFsxXSAwLDU8L2Rpdj48L2Rpdj48ZGl2Pjxicj48\r\nL2Rpdj48ZGl2PlRoZW48L2Rpdj48ZGl2Pjxicj48L2Rpdj48ZGl2PiZuYnNwOyAmbmJzcDsgJm5i\r\nc3A7ICMgbWVkaWFuIGFuZCBxdWFydGlsZXMgZm9yIGVhY2ggbGlzdCBlbGVtZW50PC9kaXY+PGRp\r\ndj4mbmJzcDsgJm5ic3A7ICZuYnNwOyBxdWFudCA9IFIubGFwcGx5KHgsICJxdWFudGlsZSIpPGJy\r\nPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2